      "widgets_values": [
        "Aesthetic: Cinematic real-time 3D game rendering, vertical portrait video, soft golden hour outdoor lighting, shallow depth of field, warm natural atmosphere, subtle film grain\n[SHOT 1]\nDuration: 0:00 - 0:06\nCamera Motion: Slow subtle push-in, minimal gentle vertical sway\nVisual Prompt: Starting from the reference frame. Beautiful young woman with extra long straight black hair, glowing amber-red eyes, wearing glossy blue zip-up camisole dress with black lace trim, blue crystal pendant necklace and tiny teardrop earrings. She stands in a sunlit wild daisy meadow, faint breeze stirs strands of her long hair, faint soft smile on her face, she slowly tilts her head slightly and blinks gently, warm sunset light wraps around her shoulders, background flower field softly blurred.\nAudio / Dialogue: Gentle light wind rustling, quiet ambient meadow sounds 轻柔女声 人声：\"风刚好停在这里了。\"\n[SHOT 2]\nDuration: 0:06 - 0:12\nCamera Motion: Slow slight clockwise orbit, keeps character centered\nVisual Prompt: Starting from the reference frame. The woman shifts her gaze softly, her hair continues to drift lightly in the wind, sunlight creates soft rim light along her hair outline, wild white daisies sway gently in the background meadow, subtle highlights glint on the blue fabric of her dress and crystal necklace. She relaxes her shoulders, maintains a calm tender expression.\nAudio / Dialogue: Continuous soft wind sound, distant faint insect chirps 轻柔女声 人声：\"这片花海，安静得刚刚好。\"",
